INT. CRYO-VAULT, DEEP STORAGE - NIGHT

Frost. Rows of sleeper pods under blue light. Six figures in thermals move between them.

SERGEANT KESTREL, scarred, ex-security. DR. PRIYA NAIR, wire-rimmed, hands shaking. OLUWASEUN, nicknamed SEUN, a maintenance rat. GUNNAR, silent, huge. TESS HALVORSEN, a trainee with a clipboard. OLD MAN BRIGHT, hundred and four, upright in a wheelchair.

KESTREL
Everyone, check your pods. Count aloud.

TESS
Four. Five. Six.

PRIYA
(muttering)
All green. All green. Why is it all green.

GUNNAR
Quiet.

SEUN
Priya, you want me on the cooling loop?

PRIYA
No. Stay here.

BRIGHT
(to the room)
Count again.

They freeze. Every pod lid is open. Every pod is empty. Kestrel and Gunnar swing their lights at each other, back to back, and the beams cross on the same blank white wall.

KESTREL
(low)
Then who's been counting us?
